WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.250
[inspirational music]

00:00.679 --> 00:02.929
[intriguing music]

00:21.929 --> 00:23.971
[light suspenseful music]

00:42.971 --> 00:45.429
[rumbling]

00:52.346 --> 00:54.388
[echoing explosion]

01:07.804 --> 01:10.054
[music increases]

01:13.138 --> 01:15.179
[engine roaring]

01:27.638 --> 01:29.429
[clinking]

01:29.596 --> 01:31.638
[wind howling]

01:37.179 --> 01:39.096
- [bell tolling]
- [indistinct chatter]

01:39.263 --> 01:40.429
[server]
<i>Prego.</i>

01:42.471 --> 01:45.679
[cell phone buzzing]

01:47.221 --> 01:51.304
<i>- Pronto.</i> Yes, this is <i>Dr.</i> Martins.
- [man] <i>Is this Dr. Martins?</i>

01:51.471 --> 01:53.846
-Who is this? <i>-NASA Space
Biosciences Research.</i>

01:54.013 --> 01:56.030
<i>- We're patching through your call.</i>
- "My call"? I don't have a...

01:56.054 --> 01:58.471
[Enos] <i>Hello? Who is
it now? Why can't I talk</i>

01:58.638 --> 02:00.638
- to <i>the same person?</i>
- Hello, this is Dr. Martins.

02:00.763 --> 02:02.263
<i>- Oh, please!</i>
- Who is this?

02:02.429 --> 02:03.846
Something came out of your tank!

02:04.013 --> 02:05.346
<i>Okay, slow down. Can you tell me</i>

02:05.513 --> 02:07.155
<i>- your name, please, sir?</i>
- I told the man!

02:07.179 --> 02:09.554
I told them all!
Six times I've called already!

02:09.721 --> 02:12.388
<i>Always a different person! W...
Where am I calling now?</i>

02:12.554 --> 02:15.513
Rome. I'm a research
microbiologist at Sapienza.

02:15.679 --> 02:17.846
<i>- Oh, why'd they give me you?</i>
- I...

02:18.013 --> 02:21.263
I consult for NASA sometimes,
epidemiological surveillance.

02:21.429 --> 02:23.346
<i>Now it's your turn.
Who are you, sir?</i>

02:23.513 --> 02:25.096
Enos Minjarra.

02:25.804 --> 02:27.346
I live in Kiwirrkurra.

02:27.513 --> 02:28.804
Kiwirrkurra, where is that?

02:29.304 --> 02:30.763
We're <i>dying!</i>

02:30.929 --> 02:33.929
We're all dying!
Something came out of your tank!

02:34.013 --> 02:37.221
- What tank?
- The one uncle found, near Tanami Basin.

02:37.388 --> 02:40.388
- Australia?
- Yes, long time ago, in the '70s!

02:41.304 --> 02:42.763
But now, something came out,

02:42.929 --> 02:45.804
and if you're NASA...
This is your tank!

02:45.971 --> 02:47.346
You have to help us!

02:48.013 --> 02:49.471
Where did the tank come from?

02:49.638 --> 02:51.155
[Dr. Martins breaking up]
<i>Where did</i>... <i>come from...</i>

02:51.179 --> 02:52.513
- Hello?
- Are you still there?

02:52.679 --> 02:54.471
- [Enos breaking up]Hello...
- Sir...

02:54.638 --> 02:57.679
- Taxi! Can you hear me, sir? I can't hear you.
- [grunting]

02:57.846 --> 02:59.429
[dial tone]

02:59.596 --> 03:01.513
[dramatic music]

03:01.679 --> 03:03.721
[crying]

03:04.429 --> 03:05.513
Help us...

03:09.471 --> 03:11.513
- [wind blowing]
- [whooshing]

03:15.471 --> 03:17.596
[engine rumbling]

03:17.763 --> 03:20.221
[creaking]

03:33.138 --> 03:34.221
[chiming]

03:34.304 --> 03:36.138
Dr. Hero Martins,

03:36.304 --> 03:37.554
Major Robert Quinn.

03:38.221 --> 03:39.346
DTRA.

03:40.013 --> 03:42.554
This is my partner,
Lieutenant Colonel Trini Romano.

03:42.721 --> 03:44.471
[spits] How are ya?

03:45.013 --> 03:46.346
Where's the rest of your team?

03:46.513 --> 03:47.513
You're looking at us.

03:50.304 --> 03:51.971
Okay, let's get started.

03:53.596 --> 03:57.554
I thought the Skylab Space
Station fell in the Indian Ocean in '79.

03:58.013 --> 03:59.679
Well, most of it did,

04:00.221 --> 04:01.741
but when it broke up
in the atmosphere,

04:01.846 --> 04:03.971
one of the 02 tanks
was recovered near here.

04:04.471 --> 04:06.429
Some guy found it,
put it in front of his house,

04:06.596 --> 04:08.156
thought people might pay
to come see it.

04:08.304 --> 04:10.096
Just an empty oxygen tank?

04:10.263 --> 04:11.846
[Hero]
No, this one wasn't empty.

04:12.013 --> 04:13.888
It was sent up
with a microbial organism,

04:14.054 --> 04:17.429
a parasitic fungus that could
adapt from one species to another.

04:17.596 --> 04:20.138
So, we sent up a terrestrial
fungus and it came back down.

04:20.304 --> 04:23.072
- What's the problem?
- The problem is, I think what went into the tank

04:23.096 --> 04:24.429
is not what came out.

04:25.429 --> 04:28.304
And now, everyone in Kiwirrkurra
is dying. Or dead.

04:29.096 --> 04:31.013
No one has been in or out
since that phone call.

04:31.179 --> 04:33.221
[ominous music]

04:36.554 --> 04:38.513
- Epinephrine, yeah?
- [Hero] Yeah.

04:38.679 --> 04:41.304
I would rather not discover
a lethal allergen the hard way.

04:41.471 --> 04:42.471
[hissing]

04:46.013 --> 04:49.138
- [Robert] <i>When were you first notified?</i>
- [Hero] <i>Less than 30 hours ago.</i>

04:49.304 --> 04:52.138
- [Trini]So, <i>when did the outbreak start?</i>
- [Hero] <i>That's unclear.</i>

04:53.013 --> 04:54.864
<i>Have you been called
for this sort of thing before?</i>

04:54.888 --> 04:57.346
[Robert]
<i>Space shit? Ooh, all the time.</i>

04:57.513 --> 04:59.679
- [Trini] <i>Robert.</i>
- [Robert] <i>Sorry. No.</i>

05:00.179 --> 05:02.054
<i>Bioweapons
and nuclear threats, yes.</i>

05:02.221 --> 05:04.471
<i>Extraterrestrials, meh, no.</i>

05:04.638 --> 05:07.558
[Trini] <i>Why would they intentionally
send a hazardous organism into space?</i>

05:07.721 --> 05:11.804
[Hero] <i>Research? To develop an
antifungal medication for astronauts.</i>

05:12.429 --> 05:13.697
[Trini]
<i>I'm switching bodycams on.</i>

05:13.721 --> 05:15.846
- [buzzing]
- [loudly breathing]

05:20.929 --> 05:22.846
[wind chimes clinking]

05:23.013 --> 05:25.054
[wind blowing]

05:30.846 --> 05:32.096
[Trini]
<i>A suitcase.</i>

05:33.763 --> 05:36.263
<i>- Somebody tried to leave.</i>
- [Robert] <i>Or they arrived.</i>

05:36.763 --> 05:39.929
<i>Maybe people come from all
over Australia just to stay here.</i>

05:40.096 --> 05:43.179
[man indistinctly speaking
on radio] <i>...and I am the light.</i>

05:43.346 --> 05:46.929
He <i>who believes in me
shall never die.</i>

05:47.096 --> 05:48.846
<i>- It shall be writ...</i>
- [click]

05:49.013 --> 05:51.054
- [creaking]
- [suspenseful music]

05:52.388 --> 05:56.304
[Robert] <i>Fourteen houses,
12 cars, and no people.</i>

05:57.471 --> 05:59.596
[Trini]
<i>So, where the hell is everybody?</i>

06:08.388 --> 06:11.138
[Hero]
<i>I found it! Over here.</i>

06:13.471 --> 06:15.138
[loudly breathing]

06:19.638 --> 06:20.888
[Robert softly]
<i>Uh-huh.</i>

06:23.471 --> 06:24.638
Here we <i>go.</i>

06:25.388 --> 06:26.989
[Hero] We <i>don't know
what we're dealing with.</i>

06:27.013 --> 06:29.013
<i>Don't touch the tank.
Stay behind me.</i>

06:41.846 --> 06:42.846
<i>Huh.</i>

06:43.763 --> 06:45.221
<i>It's a folkloric solution,</i>

06:46.138 --> 06:47.638
<i>potatoes and dish soap.</i>

06:47.804 --> 06:49.513
<i>The guy must've been trying
to clean it.</i>

06:50.721 --> 06:52.763
- [music increases]
- [loud creaking]

06:56.804 --> 06:58.013
[whirring]

06:58.846 --> 07:01.221
- [beeping]
<i>- Microfissures in the tank,</i>

07:01.388 --> 07:05.221
<i>polysaccharide in the potato,
sodium palmitate in the soap.</i>

07:05.388 --> 07:07.263
<i>Dripped into the tank,
it's protein rich.</i>

07:08.638 --> 07:12.138
<i>The guy might not have meant to, but he
created</i> one <i>hell of a pro-growth environment.</i>

07:12.304 --> 07:14.679
<i>All it needs is some water
and it would really multiply.</i>

07:14.846 --> 07:16.888
[beeping continues]

07:23.138 --> 07:24.388
<i>Who the hell are you?</i>

07:29.804 --> 07:30.804
<i>Hey, can you, um,</i>

07:31.804 --> 07:33.471
<i>just grab the loop in my suit?</i>

07:34.554 --> 07:36.179
<i>- I'm gonna pull against you.
- Yeah?</i>

07:36.346 --> 07:37.638
<i>But just don't let me go, okay?</i>

07:37.804 --> 07:39.513
<i>Yeah. I gotcha.</i>

07:39.679 --> 07:41.530
<i>All right, if I start to fall,
just pull back hard.</i>

07:41.554 --> 07:43.471
- [Robert] <i>Ready?</i>
- [Hero heavily breathing]

07:43.638 --> 07:45.638
[Robert grunts]

07:48.554 --> 07:51.096
[beeping and whirring]

07:51.263 --> 07:52.929
[Hero]
<i>Jesus Christ.</i>

07:53.388 --> 07:57.221
<i>- What is it?
- I don't know. But it's big, fast,</i>

07:57.388 --> 07:59.138
<i>and it's heterotrophic.</i>

08:00.096 --> 08:01.721
- [hissing and thudding]
- [gasping]

08:03.054 --> 08:04.804
- You <i>okay?
- Yeah, thanks.</i>

08:04.971 --> 08:07.263
<i>Hey! I found a body!</i>

08:07.429 --> 08:09.471
[suspenseful music]

08:14.721 --> 08:16.763
[loudly breathing]

08:23.054 --> 08:25.638
[dramatic tone]

08:26.929 --> 08:28.971
[squelching]

08:33.179 --> 08:35.388
- [Robert]I've <i>got you.</i>
- [Hero grunts] <i>Thanks.</i>

08:35.554 --> 08:37.596
[wind blowing]

08:48.138 --> 08:51.304
<i>Pockmarks in the skin,
erupted flesh,</i>

08:52.179 --> 08:53.179
<i>uh...</i>

08:54.721 --> 08:56.096
<i>he</i>... he <i>burst.</i>

08:56.929 --> 08:57.929
<i>Don't say.</i>

08:58.429 --> 08:59.869
[Hero]
<i>Plates of the skull are split,</i>

09:00.263 --> 09:02.346
<i>all eight seamlines.</i>

09:05.096 --> 09:07.638
- [Robert] <i>Oh, my God.
- H... what?</i>

09:10.179 --> 09:11.304
[Robert]
<i>It's all of them.</i>

09:21.888 --> 09:24.054
<i>Why the hell
they all climb their roofs?</i>

09:24.221 --> 09:26.304
- [Hero] <i>It told them to.</i>
- [Robert] <i>The fungus?</i>

09:26.471 --> 09:30.096
<i>Yes. That's how an
insect-pathogenic fungus reproduces.</i>

09:30.263 --> 09:34.179
<i>It controls all brain function,
movement, reflex, impulse.</i>

09:34.346 --> 09:37.388
<i>It's driven to infect
other hosts any way it can.</i>

09:38.013 --> 09:40.888
<i>Sometimes, it tells them
to climb and wait.</i>

09:41.054 --> 09:43.054
<i>- For what?</i>
- For <i>the fungus to overfill</i>

09:43.221 --> 09:45.888
<i>its body cavity and burst.</i>

09:46.721 --> 09:48.054
<i>And spread.</i>

09:48.221 --> 09:50.013
<i>But that's...
That's only insects.</i>

09:51.721 --> 09:52.721
<i>It was.</i>

09:55.013 --> 09:56.013
- [creaking]
- [screaming]

09:56.179 --> 09:57.179
[Robert]
<i>Jesus!</i>

09:59.471 --> 10:02.263
<i>Get your sample, doc, and
let's get the hell out of here.</i>

10:04.096 --> 10:05.856
[Hero] <i>Maybe the tank
picked up a hitchhiker,</i>

10:05.929 --> 10:08.471
<i>maybe a spore penetrated
its shell upon reentry,</i>

10:08.638 --> 10:11.513
<i>but... however it happened,</i>

10:12.554 --> 10:14.179
<i>I think we've created
a new species.</i>

10:14.346 --> 10:16.429
[light dramatic music]

10:16.596 --> 10:19.721
We need to <i>burn this place.</i>
To <i>the ground. Right away.</i>

10:19.888 --> 10:23.221
<i>A couple M47s loaded with white
phosphorous ought to do the job.</i>

10:23.388 --> 10:25.489
- [Trini] <i>Yeah.</i>
- [Robert] <i>That will cover any spread.</i>

10:25.513 --> 10:27.554
[music increases]

10:29.096 --> 10:31.138
[squelching]

10:33.554 --> 10:36.638
[creaking and whooshing]

10:36.804 --> 10:39.054
[Trini distorted]
<i>Dr. Dr. Martins.</i>

10:39.721 --> 10:41.441
- [Trini] <i>Dr. Martins?</i>
- [heavily breathing]

10:41.596 --> 10:42.971
[Trini]
Come <i>on, we need to go.</i>

10:43.429 --> 10:45.054
<i>All right, I'm done.</i>

10:48.054 --> 10:49.263
- [thud]
- [hissing]

10:49.721 --> 10:50.888
[Robert]
Come <i>on, let's move.</i>

10:58.679 --> 11:01.429
<i>You smell that? Burnt toast?</i>

11:01.929 --> 11:04.179
- [Robert] <i>In your suit?</i>
- [Hero] <i>It's not possible.</i>

11:04.346 --> 11:06.489
<i>My suit is sealed and
over-pressured, there's nothing in here</i>

11:06.513 --> 11:08.471
<i>but oxygen and clean CO2.</i>

11:09.971 --> 11:11.054
[Trini]
Feel <i>anything?</i>

11:13.263 --> 11:15.513
<i>- A little hot.</i>
- We'<i>ll lose the suits at the Jeep.</i>

11:15.679 --> 11:18.804
<i>They need to burn here anyway.</i>
We'<i>ll check yours for breaches.</i>

11:18.971 --> 11:21.971
<i>Who the hell's gonna store
this thing? CDC?</i>

11:22.138 --> 11:26.013
<i>No. Atlanta and Galveston
will both classify extraterrestrial.</i>

11:26.179 --> 11:28.304
<i>- They'll reject it outright.</i>
- [heavily breathing]

11:28.471 --> 11:31.221
- [Robert] <i>Fort Detrick?</i>
- [Trini] <i>Still in a top-down review</i>

11:31.388 --> 11:35.138
<i>- after their last breach. I wouldn't trust it to them.</i>
- [Hero whimpers]

11:35.763 --> 11:37.888
[gasping]

11:38.054 --> 11:41.554
<i>- What about Atchison?
- What, the mines in Kansas?</i>

11:41.721 --> 11:44.346
[Robert]
<i>Exactly, nobody ever uses them.</i>

11:45.221 --> 11:46.471
<i>Yeah, not bad.</i>

11:47.346 --> 11:48.846
[Hero]
<i>No. No!</i>

11:49.513 --> 11:51.304
<i>Hero? You okay?</i>

11:51.471 --> 11:53.388
[Hero]
<i>Stop! Stop...</i>

11:53.554 --> 11:54.638
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

11:55.179 --> 11:57.471
[Hero gagging and choking]

11:57.638 --> 11:59.554
[dramatic music]

11:59.721 --> 12:01.763
[whooshing]

12:05.846 --> 12:09.679
[Hero echoing]
<i>Spread, spread, spread, spread,</i>

12:09.846 --> 12:11.429
<i>spread, spread, spread!</i>

12:14.138 --> 12:15.938
- [Robert] <i>Hero, can you hear me?</i>
- [shouting]

12:16.054 --> 12:18.471
<i>She's infected! Stop!</i>

12:19.346 --> 12:21.263
<i>- Stop!</i>
- [heavily breathing]

12:21.429 --> 12:22.679
- [engine rumbling]
<i>- Stop!</i>

12:22.846 --> 12:23.846
[grunts]

12:23.971 --> 12:25.013
- [gunshot]
- [thudding]

12:25.179 --> 12:27.096
- [grunts]
- [groans]

12:28.054 --> 12:29.638
[Robert]
<i>I can't move my legs.</i>

12:29.804 --> 12:31.679
-[coughing and heavily
breathing] -[grunting]

12:31.846 --> 12:33.346
[Robert]
<i>Hero! Stop!</i>

12:33.513 --> 12:35.179
<i>- Stop!</i>
- [screams]

12:35.888 --> 12:38.763
[Robert]
<i>Hero, no! Listen to me! Stop.</i>

12:39.388 --> 12:40.721
[grunting]

12:41.804 --> 12:43.471
[loudly gasping]

12:43.638 --> 12:45.971
<i>Hero, don't! Don 't!
What are you...</i>

12:46.138 --> 12:48.513
- [Trini] <i>No, Hero. Stop.</i>
- [loudly breathing]

12:48.679 --> 12:51.054
<i>- Put it down, Hero.</i>
- [Trini] <i>Hero, you're infected!</i>

12:51.221 --> 12:52.721
[choking]

12:52.888 --> 12:54.721
[Robert]
<i>Don 't! No, no, no, no!</i>

12:54.888 --> 12:55.888
[gunshot]

12:56.013 --> 12:57.304
[thudding]

12:57.471 --> 12:58.971
[squelching]

12:59.138 --> 13:00.888
- [Robert gasps]
- [Trini] <i>Oh, God.</i>

13:02.054 --> 13:03.679
[pants] <i>Robert.</i>

13:03.846 --> 13:05.138
- [Robert groaning]
<i>- Robert!</i>

13:05.304 --> 13:08.221
[dramatic tone]

13:08.388 --> 13:10.155
-["I Get Around" by The Beach
Boys] -♪ <i>Round, round, get around</i> ♪

13:10.179 --> 13:11.596
- ♪ <i>I get around</i> ♪
- ♪ <i>Yeah</i> ♪

13:11.763 --> 13:13.346
♪ <i>Get around, round, round</i> ♪

