14:13.179 --> 14:15.971
♪ We <i>always take my car
'cause it's never been beat</i> ♪

14:16.138 --> 14:19.513
♪ <i>And we've never missed yet
with the girls we meet</i> ♪

14:22.763 --> 14:25.971
♪ None <i>of the guys go steady
'cause it wouldn't be right</i> ♪

14:26.138 --> 14:29.263
